    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Nalvessir is centered at 23.839316, 110.776447 under Communalism, with 49,799,000 people across 8 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Nalvessir occupies 6,331,211.46 sq mi / 16,397,762.41 sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory, about 3.214832% of Belavadös's surface. It is not merely a province but a continent-scale civic machine: Beach and grass with water, Partial forest and Beach and reefs with water define its broad terrain, while its settlements intensify into Beach and grass with water, Farming, Beach and reefs with water and Deep forest. Population density is 3.037 people/sq km / 7.866 people/sq mi, which lets wilderness, roads, faction-held corridors, and vast uncrowded borders remain huge.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Elf Parent Race and Elf Bloodlines, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Draconic and Reptilian Races, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Tortle, Elf — Sea Elf, Genasi — Water Genasi, Harengon, Hadozee, Triton, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Black-Maw Myriad, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Ishtanora, Bastveig, Thoryn-Rahek, Sigrananna, Iskareth, Hathruna, and 3 more.",
